# =============================================================================
# This is the Cadenza specification branch. It holds the durable source of truth:
# the specification tree, the neutral build-loop commands (commands/), and the
# entry point (start.sh). The Cadenza compiler itself is a disposable, regenerable
# projection of these specs and is NEVER committed here; it is regenerated into
# implementation/ (below), and the commands are installed into .claude/commands/
# as a local, generated target.
# =============================================================================

# The generated compiler / any synthesized implementation.
/implementation/

# Editor / OS / agent-local
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
.direnv/
result
.claude/

# stray editor/rust-analyzer flycheck output at repo root
/target/
